  "lineage": "Brazilian Afrobeat brings the ensemble language of Afrobeat into dialogue with Afro-Brazilian rhythmic traditions. Rio de Janeiro groups such as Abayomy Orquestra connect this practice with ijexá, coco, afoxé and maracatu, alongside jazz and Yoruba-language song.",
